# devenv-ai-packaging agent rules

Follow [AGENTS.md](../../AGENTS.md) in full. Summary:

- Own containers + Flatpak only; editor AI configs live in devenv-ai-assistant; CLI in devenv-ai-helper; LSP/TS in devenv-lsp-setup.
- Always stage via `scripts/prepare-build-context.sh` — never copy from `~/.config` / `~/.local` as source of truth.
- Never commit `build-context/`, staged helper binaries, secrets, or prompts.
- CI must not call third-party AI APIs with repo content.
- Verify with `./scripts/prepare-build-context.sh` when siblings are available.
